# Today's Agenda

@body

- Ice breaker and announcements
- Mendel and the origins of genetics
- The first two principles of heredity
- Cross experiments and segregation
- Punnett squares
- Independent assortment and practice problems
- Assignment 3 is due tonight
- Closing remarks

