# Approximate Exam Rules

@body

- It will be in 2 parts of about 50 questions each
  - Backtracking is allowed
  - random question order
  - Only 1½  minutes per question
    - to prevent collaboration or excessive research
- Exam questions consist of variations on the assignment and quiz questions. Very similar in format.
  - If present, essay questions will be handled in a separate part.

